---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CallToAction from '../components/CallToAction.astro';
import { organizationSchema, serviceSchema } from '../data/schema';
---
<BaseLayout title="Team Coaching & Workshops | Threads Coaching" description="Team coaching and workshops that build reflective practice, stronger connection and values-led work." path="/team-workshops" schema={[organizationSchema, serviceSchema('Team coaching and workshops', '/team-workshops', 'Team coaching and workshops for reflective practice, stronger connection and values-led work.')] }>
  <div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Teams and workshops' }]} /></div><section class="hero-copy section"><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Teams and workshops</p><h1>Turn your team’s values into the way you work together.</h1><p class="lead">Create room for better reflection, deeper connection and practical change in the everyday life of your team.</p><a class="button" href="/contact">Talk to us about your team</a></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Good teams still need space to pause and reflect.</h2><p>When pressure, caseloads or competing priorities take over, shared values can become harder to live out. A facilitated workshop can help a team notice what is happening and decide how it wants to work together.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Workshop options</p><div class="card-grid"><article class="card"><h2>Group and team coaching</h2><p>Reflective practice for teams in health, social care, pastoral and other people-facing settings. Make space to explore the work, strengthen support and sustain wellbeing.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Working Genius workshop</h2><p>Explore the parts of work that energise and frustrate people, then use that insight to improve collaboration and role clarity.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Organisational value curation</h2><p>Move beyond values on a wall by identifying the behaviours, language and choices that make them real in daily work.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><h2>A simple commissioning process</h2><ol class="steps"><li><strong>Clarify the need.</strong><span>Talk through your context, team and hoped-for outcome.</span></li><li><strong>Shape the session.</strong><span>Agree a focused, appropriate workshop or coaching approach.</span></li><li><strong>Carry learning into practice.</strong><span>Leave with shared language and useful next steps.</span></li></ol><p>Threads Coaching draws on experience in church, public and third-sector contexts. <a href="/about">Read more about the people behind the work</a>.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Questions to explore together</h2><details><summary>Can a workshop be tailored to our team?</summary><p>Yes. The starting point is your context and the change your team hopes to make.</p></details><details><summary>Is this only for church teams?</summary><p>No. The existing offer includes experience relevant to public, third-sector, health, social care and pastoral settings.</p></details></div></section>
  <CallToAction title="Give your team space to work more thoughtfully together." body="Start with a conversation about what your team needs." primaryHref="/contact" primaryLabel="Talk to us about your team" />
</BaseLayout>
